blurb: The Board held a budget workshop for the FY2025 budget, featuring presentations
  from the Special Education, Adult Education, Athletics, Technology, and Operations
  departments. The Superintendent announced a plan to retain an SPHS art teacher position
  while also committing to continue the popular Extended Learning Opportunities (ELO)
  program despite the loss of grant funding for its coordinator.
